{"id":"d82c10f45e77e524","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-satisfaction.md","title":"满足关系","display":"df-satisfaction — 满足关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-satisfaction","aliases":["28-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — 满足关系","depends_on":["[[28-df-structure]]","[[28-df-assignment]]","[[28-df-formula]]","[[28-df-term-interpretation]]","[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — 满足关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd01c8f753367315\" href=\"?note=fd01c8f753367315\" title=\"28-df-assignment\">28-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bfb27aea6f90ca07\" href=\"?note=bfb27aea6f90ca07\" title=\"28-df-term-interpretation\">28-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-satisfaction-—-满足关系-$\\models$\">df-satisfaction — 满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a> 的一阶签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)=A^{\\mathrm{Var}}\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)=A^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/x]\">\\(\\beta[a/x]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fd01c8f753367315\" href=\"?note=fd01c8f753367315\" title=\"28-df-assignment\">28-df-assignment</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>；对关系原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\">\\((t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\)</span>。项值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\">\\(t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bfb27aea6f90ca07\" href=\"?note=bfb27aea6f90ca07\" title=\"28-df-term-interpretation\">28-df-term-interpretation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>满足关系按公式有限语法树的直接子公式递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\not\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\not\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\">\\(\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(t_1\\doteq t_2)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=t_2^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(t_1\\doteq t_2)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=t_2^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\psi\\land\\chi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\chi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\psi\\land\\chi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\chi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\psi\\lor\\chi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\chi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\psi\\lor\\chi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\chi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\psi\\to\\chi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl((\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\psi\\to\\chi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl((\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl((\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\chi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl((\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\chi[\\beta])\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta[a/x]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta[a/x]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta[a/x]]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta[a/x]]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐旧递归遗漏的双条件分支，且显式给无赋值记号的全称闭包语义。对句子这与任选赋值的语义一致；论域非空保证赋值集非空。每次递归调用在严格子公式上，定义覆盖全部公式构造。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-satisfaction-—-满足关系-$\\models$","text":"df-satisfaction — 满足关系 $\\models$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Asserti