"anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"42bd57d799b5867e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A=(A,(c^{\\mathfrak A})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak A})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak A})_R),\\mathfrak B=(B,(c^{\\mathfrak B})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak B})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak B})_R)$ 是同一 $S$ 的结构，see [[28-df-structure]]。\n$\\iota:B\\to A$ 为下式量化的候选映射；赋值和满足来自 [[28-df-assignment]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"e966617a657af5ce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[28-df-sentence]] 所采用的一阶签名；$\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ 与 $\\models$ 分别来自 [[28-df-structure]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"c2cf6ca1c5f8e481","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[28-df-sentence]] 所采用的一阶签名；$\\models$ 采用 [[28-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"6230706c04da1e4e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6a128bf495f7123","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语法与语义：[[28-df-atomic-formula]]、[[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-free-variable]]、[[28-df-bound-variable]]、[[28-df-sentence]]、[[28-df-assignment]]、[[28-df-structure]]、[[28-df-term-interpretation]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]。"}],"outgoing":["7046e83df52059de","fd01c8f753367315","d9d9a691a7b0cc03","bfb27aea6f90ca07","acf90b9de82eb78c"]}